pub theorem k215PushConstant2596 (u t w c a b v: nat): $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum2596 (k215PVector u t w c a b 0 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum2616 (k215PVector u 1 (t, w) c a b 0 0 v)) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215Const2596Stage0) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215Const2596Stage1) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215Const2596Stage2) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215Const2596Stage3) k215Const2596Stage4))));

